":"2026-03-06T00:10:45Z","closed_at":"2026-01-26T21:04:53Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/115373","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115373","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115373.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115373.patch","merged_at":"2026-01-26T21:04:53Z"},"body":"When freeing a node that has a native Windows PopupMenu with a submenu, it crashes.\r\nThis happens since 4.3 as far as I can tell.\r\n\r\nReproduction example script:\r\n```gdscript\r\nfunc _ready() -> void:\r\n\tvar submenu := PopupMenu.new()\r\n\tsubmenu.add_item(\"b\")\r\n\tvar menu := PopupMenu.new()\r\n\tmenu.prefer_native_menu = true\r\n\tmenu.add_submenu_node_item(\"a\", submenu)\r\n\tadd_child(menu)\r\n\tqueue_free() # also happens on exit without this line\r\n```\r\n\r\n`p_submenu_rid` does not need to be valid, so I put the code that uses it into the if statement.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type"